      "name": "Question 5",
      "problem": "Find the third term of an arithmetic sequence if the first term is $23$ and the common difference is $-7.$",
      "worked_solution": "We will list terms of the sequence until we get to the third term. \n\nWe start with the first term $23,$ and then we calculate each subsequent term by subtracting $7$ from the previous term:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14203588/assets/86fe86315966ba57e674e652510c2814ab94f0cf8869656c9fa3b7c934801b9f.png)\n\nTherefore, the third term is $9.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
