      "name": "Question 6",
      "problem": "Find the fourth term of an arithmetic sequence if the first term is $1$ and the common difference is $-2.$",
      "worked_solution": "We will list terms of the sequence until we get to the fourth term. \n\nWe start with the first term $1,$ and then we calculate each subsequent term by subtracting $2$ from the previous term:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14203588/assets/2f8e4976e5ea05c0d238959425d4d2d5ece23d4bfae844e533e9eb484f9de18a.png)\n\nTherefore, the fourth term is $-5.$",
